# ============================================================
# .dockerignore — Exclude Files dari Build Context
# ============================================================
#
# TODO: Buat .dockerignore yang complete
#
# Prinsip: Jangan kirim ke Docker daemon file yang tidak perlu
# - Mengurangi build context size → build lebih cepat
# - Mengurangi image size (jika COPY setelah .dockerignore)
# - Menghindari sensitive files masuk ke image
#
# Checklist:
# [ ] node_modules (di-install ulang saat build)
# [ ] .git dan version control
# [ ] Environment files
# [ ] Documentation
# [ ] Development files
# [ ] CI/CD files
# [ ] IDE files
# [ ] Test files (untuk production image)
# [ ] Logs dan temporary files
# ============================================================

